---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About & Join — Canberra Runners"
  description="Canberra Runners is a local running club open to every age and level. Learn who we are, why to join, and how membership works."
  active="about"
>
  <section>
    <h1>About &amp; Join</h1>
    <p>
      Canberra Runners has been part of Canberra's running scene since 1970. We're a local club,
      not a race organiser that happens to also run a website — the weekly group runs are the
      point, and the events grow out of them.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Our mission</h2>
    <p>
      To make running in Canberra social, structured and open to anyone who wants to start —
      whether that's a first parkrun-length run or a first half marathon.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Who can join</h2>
    <p>
      Anyone. Members range from people running their first 5K to runners tackling Capital to
      Coast's 100km. Group runs are split by pace, not ability level, so there's always a group
      to run with.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Why join</h2>
    <ul class="why-list">
      <li>Member pricing on the Half Marathon, 10km and Capital to Coast</li>
      <li>Access to the quarterly Saturday training program</li>
      <li>A standing weekly run, every week of the year</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="join">
    <h2>Membership</h2>
    <table class="pricing-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col">Membership</th>
          <th scope="col">Price</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>Individual</td>
          <td>$68 / year</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Under 18</td>
          <td>$32 / year</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Family</td>
          <td>$100 / year</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p>
      Membership pays for itself on event entry alone — it saves $30 on Half Marathon entry by
      itself. Join and register for events via the
      <a href="https://canberrarunners.org.au/">official Canberra Runners site</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <address>Lennox Gardens, Flynn Drive, Canberra ACT — where our weekly group runs start.</address>
    <p>
      Follow along and ask questions on the club's official channels linked from
      <a href="https://canberrarunners.org.au/">canberrarunners.org.au</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
